        <mxCell id="foot" value="Phases run in order, each gating the next. Phase 0&#8211;1 establish a verified spec; 2&#8211;3 design it; 4&#8211;5 build with author-separated TDD behind an automated gate; 6&#8211;8 review, document, and ship; Phase 9 codifies learnings that the next cycle&#8217;s research reads back &#8212; closing the compound loop." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#777777;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
